        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathIdentifier": "track_id",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "30",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.playbackSpeed": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.playbackTickLength": "50",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.renderer": "canvas",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlayback": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlaybackDateControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlaybackPlayControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlaybackSliderControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.useOpenFreeMap": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maplibreStylePreset": "positron"
      }
    },
    "viz_md_1": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "### Playback: three cars, one hour\n\n**What this shows** - Three vehicle tracks that run close together, re-timed so they share one clock: 61 points each, one per minute from 09:00 to 10:00 on 17 November 2026. **Play** moves all three markers at the same time. The original GPS points come from the app's `go_track_trackspoints.csv` lookup.\n\n**The SPL**\n\n```spl\n| inputlookup go_track_trackspoints.csv where track_id=16 OR track_id=17 OR track_id=208\n| streamstats count as seq by track_id\n| eventstats max(seq) as points by track_id\n| eval minute=round((seq-1)*60/(points-1))\n| dedup track_id minute\n| eval _time=strftime(strptime(\"2026-11-17 09:00:00\", \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\") + minute*60, \"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S\")\n| eval description=\"car \".track_id, tooltip=description, markerVisibility=\"hidden\", pathColor=case(track_id=16, \"#e50de5\", track_id=17, \"#0003F0\", track_id=208, \"#D43C29\")\n| sort 0 track_id minute\n| table _time latitude longitude track_id description tooltip pathColor markerVisibility\n```\n\n**How it works**\n\n1. `inputlookup ... where track_id=...` keeps three cars (16, 17 and 208) that drive through the same part of town on different routes, each covering about 2.5 km.\n2. `streamstats count as seq by track_id` numbers each car's points in recorded order, and `eventstats max(seq) as points` counts them.\n3. `minute=round((seq-1)*60/(points-1))` spreads each car's points evenly over 0 to 60 minutes, and `dedup track_id minute` keeps one point per car per minute, so every car has exactly 61 points.\n4. `_time` is rebuilt as 09:00 plus `minute` minutes, in ISO format (`2026-11-17T09:05:00`). Because all three cars use the same 61 timestamps, they start, move and stop together.\n5. `sort 0 track_id minute` puts each path in time order. Maps+ never sorts rows itself.\n6. Options: `showPathLines=1` and `pathIdentifier=track_id` build one path per car; `showPlayback=1` adds every path to playback; the date, play and slider controls are switched on with `showPlaybackDateControl`, `showPlaybackPlayControl` and `showPlaybackSliderControl`.\n\n**Field formats and rules**\n\n| Field | Expected format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `latitude`, `longitude` | decimal degrees | Exact lowercase names. Every row is a path vertex. |\n| `_time` | a timestamp Maps+ can parse (ISO `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS` is safest) | Playback advances along it. It is read in the viewer's browser time zone. Rows must already be in time order within each path. |\n| `track_id` | any text; the field named in `pathIdentifier` | Splits rows into paths. Without `pathIdentifier`, all rows form one path. |\n| `description`, `tooltip` | HTML text | Popup and hover text; a path takes them from its first row. |\n| `pathColor` | CSS colour | Colour of the path and its moving marker. A path's style comes from its first row. |\n| `markerVisibility` | `\"true\"` / `\"marker\"` shows; anything else hides | Hides the static marker on every vertex, so only the paths and the moving markers show. |\n| `playback` | `\"true\"` / `\"false\"` per row | Not set here; the `showPlayback` option applies. A per-row `\"false\"` leaves that path out of playback. |\n\n**Try it**\n\n- Change `minute*60` to `minute*30` in the `_time` eval to squeeze the same trips into 30 minutes.\n- Add `, playback=if(track_id=208, \"false\", \"true\")` to the last `eval`: only cars 16 and 17 move.\n- Give one car a head start: add `+ if(track_id=17, 600, 0)` inside `strptime(...) + minute*60` and watch car 17 begin ten minutes later.\n\n**Basemap:** keyless OpenFreeMap vector tiles (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1). CARTO basemaps need a free API key: see **Help > Basemaps & API keys**."
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "globalInputs": [],
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 980,
          "display": "auto",
          "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "viz_html",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 260
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map_1",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 260,
              "w": 880,
              "h": 720
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_md_1",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 880,
              "y": 260,
              "w": 560,
              "h": 720
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
